```html
<script setup>
import { ref, computed } from 'vue';
const price = ref(10);
const count = ref(2);
const theme = ref('light');
let calls = 0;
const total = computed(() => {
  calls++;
  return price.value * count.value;
});
</script>

<template>
  <p>{{ total }}</p>
  <p>{{ theme }}</p>
  <button @click="theme = theme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light'">切换</button>
</template>

其中题目所称 expensive 即 computed 回调；初次渲染完成后再连续点击两次。
